WEBVTT

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.010
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.060
<i>Agumon.</i>

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:18.020
<i>A very curious Digimon who loves eating.</i>

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.020
LEVEL: ROOKIE

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.600
TYPE: REPTILE

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.140
<i>Agumon shoots Baby Flame from the mouth
and uses sharp claws to fight.</i>

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.250
SPECIAL MOVE: BABY FLAME

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.860
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.420
<i>Agumon and Taichi-san
are perfectly in sync.</i>

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.820
<i>They are bound by a strong friendship.</i>

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:35.010
<i>That strong bond may lead
to an unexpected situation.</i>

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.290
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.130
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.130
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.220
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.220
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.980
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.980
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.990
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.990
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.200
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.200
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.370
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.370
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.800
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.800
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:37.590
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:37.590
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.470
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.470
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.690
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.690
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.570
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.570
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.360
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.360
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:04.200
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:04.200
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.560
<i>The journey continues
to find the Holy Digimon,</i>

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.250
<i>the key to ending Tokyo's blackout.</i>

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:22.640
<i>Taichi's party crosses the Digital World's
sea and reaches new land.</i>

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.640
<i>But what awaited them were attacks
from a fortress built on the shore.</i>

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:36.700
<i>Then, Taichi reunites
with the boy he once fought with before,</i>

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:41.240
<i>Yamato, and his partner Gabumon.</i>

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.790
<i>To move forward</i>

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:51.460
<i>and to find the identity
of those who target them,</i>

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:55.130
<i>the six children and Digimon
cooperate with one another.</i>

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:58.570
<i>They break through the enemy's
defenses led by Gorimon</i>

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:01.740
<i>and succeed in neutralizing the fortress.</i>

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:12.110
<i>By decoding the information left
inside the fortress,</i>

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:13.830
<i>Taichi finds...</i>

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:16.860
This...

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:17.800
Huh?

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:22.030
This is about the Holy Digimon!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:31.000
<i>We're in the city
where we're about to experience</i>

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.290
<i>the first evening
during this mysterious power outage.</i>

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:39.510
<i>As you can see, all city lights are out
except for self-generated facilities.</i>

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.510
<i>We are shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:47.600
<i>The government has named this incident
the "Metropolitan Power Loss Disaster,"</i>

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.890
<i>and they are asking people
to stay indoors...</i>

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:57.130
ORGEMON

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.370
The Chosen Ones...

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:17.400
I ordered you to finish them.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.090
I will send new soldiers over.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:24.840
Be sure to complete
your mission next time.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.600
Otherwise...

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.350
You know the consequences.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.070
THE ULTIMATE DIGIMON ATTACKS

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:08.890
"The Holy... Digimon...

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:14.400
is within... our hands... of darkness...

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.520
Now... that power..."

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.780
"Within our hands"?

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.690
It means captured.

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:23.410
By whom?

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:28.040
"Our" must mean the allies of the guys
who were in this fortress.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.320
What else?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:34.640
It's no use.
The rest... I can't exactly read it well.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.900
They tried to kill us
and captured the Holy Digimon too...

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.840
What could their purpose possibly be?

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:47.050
Anyhow, if the Holy Digimon's captured,
we need to plan a rescue fast.

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:49.410
A rescue? Where?

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.350
Where else could it be?

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.890
What? Mimi-kun, you know where?

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.440
Somewhere on this continent.

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:59.650
Jeez, "somewhere" isn't going to help,
Mimi-kun...

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.740
Err... a map! If only we had a map!

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:06.450
I don't think a map will have
our goal marked on it though...

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.870
To those guys, this fortress

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:15.120
must be a base to repel intruders
from coming onto the continent.

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.830
Their headquarters should be elsewhere.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:23.090
If the Holy Digimon is captured,
that's where we need to look.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:28.300
And those guys will target us
and surely appear before us again.

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.950
We just have to
force that information out of them.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:52.160
That's...

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.090
Evolve now!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.670
Let's go, Agumon.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:39.710
Okay!

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.890
Whoa! What's this?!

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.020
What a powerful aura!

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:59.060
That's Orgemon!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.900
Orgemon looks super angry!

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:04.110
I remember! It's the guy who attacked us!

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:06.730
So that guy came after us?!

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:09.910
What do you want?

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:12.820
Did you come to attack us again?!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:17.740
Are you with the guys
who captured the Holy Digimon?!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.880
My horn...

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.590
You broke...

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:32.650
Horn is... pride.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:34.550
Pride...

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.390
Revenge, huh...

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.940
Fight me.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.770
Win... to reclaim pride.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.150
Taichi...

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:22.200
Agumon Evolution!

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.410
Greymon!

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:04.310
Taichi...

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.270
It's like a movie...

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.210
Now what?!

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:10.690
Oh!

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.950
Giant flying Digimon! Lots of them too!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:16.400
Coredramon!

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:24.700
Gabumon!

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.140
Gabumon Evolution!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.110
Garurumon!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:03.640
Piyomon!

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.170
You guys!

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.660
Fox Fire!

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:41.990
This is the Mega Blaster!

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.550
How you like that?!

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.060
That's...

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.560
Everybody!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:56.820
Ah. Thank you for waiting!

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:59.460
I've joined you at last!

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:03.930
Ugh, that was tough. What a long flight...

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:06.350
You did fly the entire way here.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:08.080
Thank you, Tentomon.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.940
Koshiro-kun!

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:11.830
Nice meeting you!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.330
I'm the leader here, Joe Kido!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.320
Huh? Since when?

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:22.490
Evolve again!

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.840
N-N-N-N-Not possible!

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:33.270
Haoken!

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:55.980
Greymon.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:57.900
Child.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.030
Match...

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.740
Starts now!

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:39.860
The Coredramon are fleeing!

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:41.990
How's that?! Had enough?!

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.700
Um, you didn't defeat them...

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.630
Hm?

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.760
Koshiro-san, what's the matter?

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:52.890
Have the attacks really ended?

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.040
I have... a bad feeling...

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:31.890
Greymon!

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:31.640
Incredible!

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:34.220
This battle's different from before.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:36.580
They had such fierce looks earlier,

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.230
but now they look like
they're kind of having fun...

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:08.690
Haoken!

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:18.160
Mega Flame!

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:02.100
What in the world...

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.640
METALTYRANOMON

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:19.620
What is that?!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.000
Hey, could that be...

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.870
This is bad, we've got a behemoth here.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:28.210
Garurumon... is that...

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:31.170
Yeah, an Ultimate Digimon!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:33.900
An Ultimate Digimon?!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:36.970
An... Ultimate... Digimon...

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:43.600
The voice that led us here said
that all will grow, mature...

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:49.940
and become a stronger,
completely evolved Digimon!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:18:00.330
Let there be destruction... and death...

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:20.390
Greymon!

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:25.410
Orgemon...

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:14.170
Greymon!

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:26.930
So this is...

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:30.690
the power of an Ultimate Digimon...

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.940
Agumon! Hang in there!

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:36.800
Agumon!

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:54.960
I...

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.900
I've been... replaced.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:18.400
Hao... ken!

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:35.650
Go...

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.070
Holy Digimon...

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:42.380
Lies ahead...

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.950
Go straight...

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:52.460
Straight ahead...

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.040
Orgemon...

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.560
Orgemon!

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:11.160
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:11.160
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:17.670
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:17.670
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.380
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.380
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:27.010
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:27.010
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:30.850
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:30.850
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:36.690
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:36.690
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:38.980
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:38.980
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:47.400
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:47.400
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.490
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.490
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:52.780
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:52.780
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.540
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.540
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.660 --> 00:23:00.540
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

00:22:55.660 --> 00:23:00.540
<i>ima nara kitto sora mo toberu kara</i>

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:04.130
<i>To open up a path for their friends,</i>

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:07.170
<i>Taichi and Agumon challenge
the ultimate enemy to battle!</i>

00:23:07.300 --> 00:23:11.300
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Steel-Solid Super Evolution"</i>

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:13.970
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
